omponents/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#component-customization","content":"Individual components can be styled by passing `className` props:"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-28","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key     | Action                                                 |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Tab** | Moves focus to/from the button group (single tab stop) |","table":"table-0"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-29","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key                    | Action                                                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Arrow Left / Right** | Move focus between items (RAC automatically reverses in RTL) |","table":"table-0"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-30","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key               | Action                  |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------- |\n| **Space / Enter** | Toggle the focused item |","table":"table-0"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-31","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key      | Action                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Home** | Move focus to the first item |","table":"table-0"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-32","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key     | Action                    