itted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[664,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[729,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[746,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[739,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1155,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1154,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[899,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1310,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[853,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[730,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[725,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[210,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[241,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1602,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[215,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[239,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[236,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1277,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1278,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1340,"**Shared structural containers.** Thes