date the group's `expandedKeys` instead."],[923,"Usable anchored to a trigger or standalone (e.g. inside a bottom-sheet `Drawer`)"],[320,"Use **`desc`** for a longer description rendered in the SVG `<desc>` for screen readers."],[247,"Use **custom domains** to maintain consistent scales across multiple charts"],[1603,"Use **title case**: capitalize the first letter of each word, except short prepositions."],[762,"Use `alt=\"\"` for decorative images or images already described by adjacent text."],[106,"Use `alt=\"\"` on the Image and `aria-hidden=\"true\"` on the Avatar when the entire avatar is purely decorative."],[1086,"Use `Box slot=\"value\"` for formatted or custom content, or `Text slot=\"value\"` for typography controls.\nThe root's children render function provides progress state. Customize layout and styling with\nGrid props, `className`, and `style`."],[1062,"Use `Button` when you need a standard button control with button-specific sizing, layout, and visual variants."],[441,"Use `ChipButton` inside `MenuTrigger`, include the visible value, and add a\ntrailing chevron to communicate that the control opens a menu."],[426,"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."],[491,"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"],[46,"Use `className` and `style` to customize the group container. `data-disabled` reflects the group's\ndisabled state. Customize individual headings, triggers, and panels on the composed Collapsible sections."],[1017,"Use `className` to extend styling without replacing the interaction behavior\nprovided by Antares."],[176,"Use `className` with `[data-selected]`, `[data-hovered]`, `[data-pressed]`, `[data-focus-visible